     "type": "text",
     "text": "fl studio question. making a lofi-ish beat, chopped a soul sample into slicex, kick + bass are fighting the sample. i want the sample to duck when the kick hits. whats the cleanest way in fl 21",
     "citations": []
    }
   ],
   "sender": "human",
   "index": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-02-22T06:10:00.000000Z",
   "updated_at": "2026-02-22T06:10:00.000000Z",
   "truncated": false,
   "attachments": [],
   "files": [],
